  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Smallholder Farmer Resilience through Innovative Financing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to build on the existing work by UNDP in the agriculture sector and leverage the findingsfrom UNDP Sri Lanka SDG Investor Map, to implement an innovative agro-pastoral farming model, linkedto agriculture focused, inclusive financing products for 1000 women beneficiaries in the Northern SriLankan districts of Mullaitivu and Kilinochchi. The project will improve the productive capacity of womensmallholder farmers, improve access to finance and enhance community resilience and the</narrative>
  </description>
